            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>There is described a method for negotiating a door while maneuvering a transporter. The method comprises: identifying a plane in segmented data; identifying a door and/or a doorway in the plane; positioning the transporter for entering the doorway based on said identifying; and generating a signal configured for moving the transporter through the doorway. The transporter responds to the signal.</p>
